# Pin LF end-of-line for the HyPeRAGInT env layer regardless of core.autocrlf.
# Suit files are sourced by POSIX shells on fleet nodes; a trailing CR from a
# CRLF checkout would corrupt every value (HYPERAGINT_NODE=5090<CR> never
# matches the dispatch join key). This file lives INSIDE env/ so the pattern
# scopes to the env layer only and the entry-dir root stays untouched —
# the root belongs to the identity layer (kanban t_0a9c4bcb).
* text eol=lf
